# Only what the image builds from. The toolchain stage reads the Rust
# version from rust-toolchain.toml; the build stage copies no more than the
# sources, so the file never makes rustup fetch its rustfmt and clippy.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!src/
!src/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!Dockerfile
